    title: zh ? "实验室现在的样子" : "The lab now",
    note: zh
      ? "研究人员的博士学历、大家写明的团队、所在地，以及快照当天仍在招聘的岗位。"
      : "Doctorates among its researchers, the groups people name, where they are, and the postings open on the day of the snapshot.",
