    note: zh
      ? "Meta 的 AI 员工写明了哪些单元，实验室在其中的位置，以及可见人数和 Meta 报告的员工数相比如何。"
      : "Which units Meta's AI staff name, where the lab sits among them, and how the visible count compares with Meta's reported headcount.",
  },
  {
    id: "part-work",
    figures: ["12", "13", "14"],
    title: zh ? "工作" : "The work",
    note: zh
      ? "实验室和 Meta 其他 AI 员工做什么、在什么层级、用什么职位名称、在哪些技术方向，以及 Meta 的岗位在招什么。"
      : "What the lab and the rest of Meta's AI staff do, at what level, under which titles, and in which technical directions, against what Meta's postings ask for.",
  },
  {
    id: "part-in-out",
    figures: ["15", "16", "17"],
    title: zh ? "流入与流出" : "In and out",
    note: zh
      ? "他们以前在哪里读书和工作，2025 年 6 月以来 Meta 和十家公司之间的人员流动，以及 Meta 的 AI 岗位写明的底薪。"
      : "Where Meta's AI staff studied and worked before, who moved between Meta and ten employers since June 2025, and the base pay Meta's AI postings state.",
  },
];
---

{section === "card" && null}

{
  section === "body" && (
    <>
      <header class="mx-hero">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="mx-top">
            <div class="mx-text">
              <nav class="mx-eyebrow" aria-label={zh ? "页面路径" : "Breadcrumb"}>
                <a href={href(lang)}>Casebook</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>{" "}
                <a href={`${href(lang)}?format=report#index`}>{zh ? "报告" : "Reports"}</a>
              </nav>
              <p class="mx-meta">
                {zh ? "报告" : "Report"} ·{" "}
                <a href={`${href(lang)}?data=people#index`}>{zh ? "个人档案" : "Profiles"}</a> ·{" "}
                <span class="nowrap">{iso}</span>
              </p>
              <h1 set:html={titleHtml(entry.title[lang], lang)} />
              <p class="mx-dek" set:html={titleHtml(entry.dek[lang], lang)} />
              <div class="mx-actions">
                <a class="mx-chip" href="#run">{zh ? "运行这个案例" : "Run it"}</a>
                <a class="mx-chip" href="#stage-2">{zh ? "第二阶段：组织地图" : "Stage 2: the map"}</a>
                <a class="mx-chip" href="#run-reproduce">
                  {zh ? `复现需 ${receipt.credits} Credits` : `${receipt.credits} Credits to reproduce`}
                </a>
                <span class="mx-note">{zh ? "复现只计数，不读取任何个人档案" : "Reproducing reads no profiles: every number is a count"}</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mx-side">
              <dl class="mx-pair">
                <div class="stay">
                  <dt>{n(stayed)}</dt>
                  <dd
                    set:html={titleHtml(
                      zh
                        ? `${n(total)} 人中，2025 年 6 月实验室成立时已在 Meta 工作的人数（${pct(stayed / total)}）`
                        : `of the ${n(total)} were at Meta when the lab formed in June 2025 (${pct(stayed / total)})`,
                      lang,
                    )}
                  />
                </div>
                <div class="new">
                  <dt>{n(aiLabs)}</dt>
                  <dd
                    set:html={titleHtml(
                      zh
                        ? `从外部加入的 ${n(outside)} 人中，刚离开五家 AI 实验室之一的人数（${pct(aiLabs / outside)}）`
                        : `of the ${n(outside)} who joined from outside had just left one of five AI labs (${pct(aiLabs / outside)})`,
                      lang,
                    )}
                  />
                </div>
              </dl>
              <p class="mx-pair-note">
                {zh ? (
                  <>
                    Meta 在 2025 年 6 月 30 日
                    <a href={MEMO}>宣布成立该实验室</a>
                    时，把现有的 AI 团队（包括 FAIR）并入其中，所以实验室里本来就会有很多老员工。个人档案显示的是有多少，以及谁是新加入的。
                  </>
                ) : (
                  <>
                    Meta put its existing AI teams, FAIR among them, into the lab when it <a href={MEMO}>announced it</a> on June 30,
                    2025, so many long-time staff were always going to be in it. The profiles show how many, and who came in.
                  </>
                )}
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mx-strip-head">
            <p class="mx-strip-title" id="strip-title" set:html={titleHtml(zh ? `写明实验室的 ${n(total)} 人，按实验室成立时所处的位置` : `The ${n(total)} who name the lab, by where they stood when it formed`, lang)} />
            <p class="mx-strip-key" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="sk st">{zh ? `${n(stayed)} 人成立时已在 Meta` : `${n(stayed)} at Meta when it formed`}</span>
              <span class="sk hb">{zh ? `${n(hadBeen)} 人以前在 Meta，当时不在` : `${n(hadBeen)} had worked at Meta, not then`}</span>
              <span class="sk nw">{zh ? `${n(fresh)} 人是 Meta 新人` : `${n(fresh)} new to Meta`}</span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="mx-strip"
            role="img"
            aria-labelledby="strip-title"
            aria-describedby="strip-desc"
            style={`--cut: ${cutAt * 100}%`}
          >
            <span class="mx-strip-found">{zh ? "实验室成立，2025 年 6 月" : "Lab formed, June 2025"}</span>
            {stripLayouts.map((l) => (
              <svg
                class={`mx-strip-svg r${l.rows}`}
                viewBox={`0 0 ${l.cols} ${l.height}`}
                preserveAspectRatio="none"
                style={`height: ${l.height}px`}
                aria-hidden="true"
                focusable="false"
              >
                {l.lines.map((m) => (
                  <line class={m.cls} x1={m.x1} x2={m.x2} y1={m.y} y2={m.y} stroke-width={l.h} stroke-dasharray="0.62 0.38" />
                ))}
              </svg>
            ))}
          </div>
          <p class="visually-hidden" id="strip-desc">
            {zh
              ? `${n(stayed)} 人在实验室成立时已在 Meta，${n(hadBeen)} 人以前在 Meta 但当时不在，${n(fresh)} 人是 Meta 新人。`
              : `${n(stayed)} were at Meta when the lab formed, ${n(hadBeen)} had worked at Meta before but not then, and ${n(fresh)} were new to Meta.`}
          </p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="wrap report-body">
        <section class="text-block rail-block" aria-labelledby="who-title">
          <div class="rail">
            <h2 id="who-title">{zh ? "统计的是谁" : "Who is counted"}</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="rail-main">
            <dl class="criteria">
              {(zh
                ? [
                    ["写明实验室", `个人资料标题或当前职位写有 superintelligence 或 MSL：${n(total)} 个档案，其中 ${n(narrowTotal)} 个写的是 superintelligence。`],
                    ["雇主", "当前有一段在 Meta 的工作。Metix AI Platform 把 Facebook 和 Meta 视为同一个雇主；以前的 Meta 工作也包括 Instagram、WhatsApp 和 Oculus。"],
                    ["成立时已在 Meta", "有一段不是实习的 Meta 工作，开始于 2025 年 6 月以前，并且到 2025 年 5 月或更晚仍在进行。"],
                    ["外部加入", "其余的人：Meta 新人，离开后又回到 Meta 的人，以及只在 Meta 实习过的人。"],
                    ["日期", "工作开始日期截至 2026 年 4 月。个人档案更新有滞后，最后几个月的人数偏少。只写年份的日期按 1 月算。"],
                    ["计数的含义", "这是自己写明实验室的人的可见档案，数的是档案，不是实验室的人数。不点任何人的名字。"],
                  ]
                : [
                    ["Named the lab", `The headline or current title says superintelligence or MSL: ${n(total)} profiles, ${n(narrowTotal)} of which write superintelligence.`],
                    ["Employer", "A current job at Meta. The Metix AI Platform treats Facebook and Meta as one employer; an earlier Meta job also includes Instagram, WhatsApp, and Oculus."],
                    ["At Meta when it formed", "A Meta job, not an internship, that began before June 2025 and was still running in May 2025 or later."],
                    ["Outside hires", "Everyone else: people new to Meta, people who worked at Meta and came back, and people who had only interned there."],
                    ["Dates", "Job start dates run to April 2026. Profiles lag, so the last months are undercounted. A date given only as a year reads as January."],
                    ["What a count is", "These are visible profiles of people who chose to name the lab: a count of profiles, not the lab's headcount. No one is named."],
                  ]
              ).map(([term, text]) => (
                <div>
                  <dt>{term}</dt>
                  <dd set:html={titleHtml(text, lang)} />
                </div>
              ))}
            </dl>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="text-block rail-block" aria-labelledby="brief-title">
          <div class="rail">
            <h2 id="brief-title">{zh ? "要点" : "In brief"}</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="rail-main">
            <ol class="brief-list">
              {(zh
                ? [
                    `写明实验室的 ${n(total)} 人中，${n(stayed)} 人（${pct(stayed / total)}）在实验室成立时已在 Meta。只算写 superintelligence 的 ${n(narrowTotal)} 人，这个比例是 ${pct(narrowStayed / narrowTotal)}。`,
                    `${n(fresh)} 名 Meta 新人从 2025 年 6 月（实验室成立的那个月）起集中加入：其中 ${n(summer)} 人在 6 月到 9 月加入。`,
                    `${n(outside)} 名外部加入者中，${n(aiLabs)} 人（${pct(aiLabs / outside)}）刚离开五家 AI 实验室之一，其中 ${n(deepmind)} 人来自 Google DeepMind；${n(uni)} 人来自大学，${n(scale)} 人来自 Scale AI。`,
                    `外部加入者更偏研究：${pct(research.outside_share)} 做研究，已在 Meta 的人是 ${pct(research.stayed_share)}。实验室研究人员中 ${pct(labPhd.share)} 写有博士学历，Meta 其他研究人员是 ${pct(basePhd.share)}。`,
                  ]
                : [
                    `${n(stayed)} of the ${n(total)} who name the lab (${pct(stayed / total)}) were at Meta when it formed. Among the ${n(narrowTotal)} who write superintelligence, the share is ${pct(narrowStayed / narrowTotal)}.`,
                    `The ${n(fresh)} who were new to Meta arrived in a burst from June 2025, the month the lab formed: ${n(summer)} of them from June to September.`,
                    `${n(aiLabs)} of the ${n(outside)} outside hires (${pct(aiLabs / outside)}) had just left one of five AI labs, ${n(deepmind)} of them Google DeepMind; ${n(uni)} came from a university and ${n(scale)} from Scale AI.`,
                    `Outside hires lean toward research: ${pct(research.outside_share)} of them work in research, against ${pct(research.stayed_share)} of those already at Meta. ${pct(labPhd.share)} of the lab's research staff list a doctorate, against ${pct(basePhd.share)} of Meta's other research staff.`,
                  ]
              ).map((text) => (
                <li>
                  <span set:html={zh ? titleHtml(text, "zh") : text} />
                </li>
              ))}
            </ol>
          </div>
        </section>

        <Contents lang={lang} parts={parts} />

        <Chapter lang={lang} part={1} {...parts[0]} />

        <Figure
          id="joined"
          level={3}
          number="01"
          lang={lang}
          heading={
            zh
              ? `典型成员在 ${medianYear} 年首次加入 Meta；新人在 2025 年夏天集中加入`
              : `The typical member first joined Meta in ${medianYear}; newcomers arrived in a burst in the summer of 2025`
          }
          sub={
            zh
              ? "写明实验室的人首次加入 Meta 的时间。高度是每年首次加入的人数，所以长短不同的时段可以比较；条上的数字是人数"
              : "When the people who name the lab first joined Meta. Height is first joins per year, so periods of different lengths compare; the number on each bar is people"
          }
          alt={bands
            .map((b) => {
              const when = !b.from
                ? zh
                  ? "2014 年以前"
                  : "Before 2014"
                : b.before
                  ? spanLabel(b.from, b.before)
                  : `${spanLabel(b.from, null)}${zh ? "，或没有开始日期" : ", or no start date"}`;
              const rate = b.from ? (zh ? `，每年 ${n(Math.round(b.rate))} 人` : `, ${n(Math.round(b.rate))} a year`) : "";
              return `${when}${zh ? "：" : ": "}${n(b.count)}${zh ? " 人" : ""}${rate}`;
            })
            .join(zh ? "；" : "; ")}
          source={source}
          queries={queries}
        >
          <p class="legend" slot="legend" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="lg lg-st">{zh ? "2025 年 6 月以前首次加入" : "First joined before June 2025"}</span>
            <span class="lg lg-nw">{zh ? "2025 年 6 月起首次加入" : "First joined from June 2025"}</span>
          </p>
          <div class="mx-sky" aria-hidden="true">
            {[
              { key: "before", tag: zh ? "2025 年 6 月以前，按年" : "Before June 2025, by year", bars: beforeBands, x: xBefore, w: wBefore, ticks: beforeTicks },
              { key: "after", tag: zh ? "2025 年 6 月起，按月" : "From June 2025, by month", bars: afterBands, x: xAfter, w: wAfter, ticks: afterTicks },
            ].map((p) => (
              <div class:list={["mx-sky-panel", p.key]}>
                <p class="mx-sky-tag">{p.tag}</p>
                <div class="mx-sky-y">
                  {yTicks.map((t) => (
                    <span style={`bottom: ${(t / yMax) * 100}%`}>{n(t)}</span>
                  ))}
                </div>
                <div class="mx-sky-area">
                  {yTicks.slice(1).map((t) => (
                    <span class="grid" style={`bottom: ${(t / yMax) * 100}%`} />
                  ))}
                  {p.bars.map((b) => (
                    <span class="bar" style={`left: ${p.x(b.a)}; width: ${p.w(b)}; height: ${h(b.rate)}`}>
                      <em>{n(b.count)}</em>
                    </span>
                  ))}
                </div>
                <div class="mx-sky-x">
                  {p.ticks.map((t) => (
                    <span class:list={{ mid: t.mid }} style={`left: ${p.x(t.t)}`}>
                      {zh && t.yr && <span class="yr">{t.yr}</span>}
                      {t.label}
                      {!zh && t.yr && <span class="yr">{t.yr}</span>}
                    </span>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
          <p
            class="mx-sky-foot"
            aria-hidden="true"
            set:html={titleHtml(
              zh
                ? `纵轴：每年首次加入的人数。另有 ${n(openBand.count)} 人在 2014 年以前首次加入，未画出。`
                : `Vertical axis: first joins per year. Another ${n(openBand.count)} first joined before 2014 and are not drawn.`,
              lang,
            )}
          />
          <FigNotes
            slot="notes"
            lang={lang}
            shows={
              zh
                ? [
                    `{{hl|${n(everBefore)} 人}}在 2025 年 6 月以前首次加入 Meta，占写明实验室的人的 ${pct(everBefore / total)}；一半的人在 ${medianYear} 年底以前首次加入。2025 年 6 月到 9 月，平均每月 ${n(Math.round(summer / summerMonths))} 人首次加入，2024 年是每月 ${n(Math.round(y2024.count / 12))} 人。`,
                  ]
                : [
                    `{{hl|${n(everBefore)} people}} first joined Meta before June 2025, ${pct(everBefore / total)} of those who name the lab; half had first joined by the end of ${medianYear}. From June to September 2025, first joins averaged ${n(Math.round(summer / summerMonths))} a month, against ${n(Math.round(y2024.count / 12))} a month in 2024.`,
                  ]
            }
            method={
              zh
                ? [
                    `首次加入是一个人最早那段 Meta 工作的开始日期，包括实习，所以成立前的部分也包括离开后又回来的人和只实习过的人（合计 ${n(hadBeen)} 人）。最后一段截至 2026 年 4 月，其中有不到 10 人没有开始日期；个人档案有滞后，这一段很可能偏少。早年只算到现在仍在 Meta、并写明实验室的人，所以和最近几个月相比会偏少。只写年份的开始日期按 1 月算，所以只写了 2025 年的新人会算在 2025 年 6 月以前。`,
                  ]
                : [
                    `A first join is the start of a person's earliest Meta entry, internships included, so the part before the lab also holds those who left and came back or only interned (${n(hadBeen)} together). The last period runs to April 2026 and holds fewer than 10 with no start date; profiles lag, so it is probably undercounted. Earlier years count only people who are still at Meta and name the lab now, so they run low next to the recent months. A start date given only as a year reads as January, so a newcomer who wrote only 2025 counts before June 2025.`,
                  ]
            }
          />
        </Figure>

        <Figure
          id="cohorts"
          level={3}
          number="02"
          lang={lang}
          heading={
            zh
              ? `${pct(stayed / total)} 的人在实验室成立时已在 Meta；只算写 superintelligence 的人是 ${pct(narrowStayed / narrowTotal)}`
              : `${pct(stayed / total)} were at Meta when the lab formed, and ${pct(narrowStayed / narrowTotal)} of those who write superintelligence`
          }
          sub={zh ? "每一行是 100%，按实验室成立时所处的位置拆分" : "Each row is 100%, split by where people stood when the lab formed"}
          alt={
            zh
              ? `写 superintelligence 或 MSL：${n(stayed)} 人成立时在 Meta，${n(hadBeen)} 人以前在，${n(fresh)} 人是新人；只写 superintelligence：${n(narrowStayed)} / ${n(narrowTotal)}；团队成立前在本公司工作过：Meta ${pct(everBefore / total)}，Microsoft ${pct(msBefore / msTotal)}`
              : `Superintelligence or MSL: ${n(stayed)} at Meta when it formed, ${n(hadBeen)} had worked there before, ${n(fresh)} new; superintelligence only: ${n(narrowStayed)} of ${n(narrowTotal)}; worked at the company before its team formed: Meta ${pct(everBefore / total)}, Microsoft ${pct(msBefore / msTotal)}`
          }
          source={source}
          queries={queries}
        >
          <p class="legend" slot="legend" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="lg lg-st">{zh ? "成立时已在 Meta" : "At Meta when it formed"}</span>
            <span class="lg lg-hb">{zh ? "以前在 Meta，当时不在" : "Had worked at Meta, not then"}</span>
            <span class="lg lg-nw">{zh ? "Meta 新人" : "New to Meta"}</span>
          </p>
          <div class="mx-ck" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="mx-ck-row">
              <p class="mx-ck-name">
                {zh ? "写 superintelligence 或 MSL" : "Write superintelligence or MSL"} <span>{n(total)}</span>
              </p>
              <div class="mx-ck-cell">
                <div class="mx-ck-bar">
                  <span class="st" style={`flex: ${stayed} 1 0px`} />
                  <span class="hb" style={`flex: ${hadBeen} 1 0px`} />
                  <span class="nw" style={`flex: ${fresh} 1 0px`} />
                </div>
                <p class="mx-ck-vals">
                  <b class="st">{pct(stayed / total)}</b>
                  <b class="nw">{pct(fresh / total)}</b>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mx-ck-row">
              <p class="mx-ck-name">
                {zh ? "只写 superintelligence" : "Write superintelligence only"} <span>{n(narrowTotal)}</span>
              </p>
              <div class="mx-ck-cell">
                <div class="mx-ck-bar">
                  <span class="st" style={`flex: ${narrowStayed} 1 0px`} />
                  <span class="rest" style={`flex: ${narrowTotal - narrowStayed} 1 0px`} />
                </div>
                <p class="mx-ck-vals">
                  <b class="st">{pct(narrowStayed / narrowTotal)}</b>
                  <b>{zh ? `其余 ${pct(1 - narrowStayed / narrowTotal)}` : `The rest ${pct(1 - narrowStayed / narrowTotal)}`}</b>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mx-ck-sub">
              {zh ? "同一口径比较两家：团队成立前在本公司工作过（含实习）" : "One measure for both labs: had worked at the company before its team formed, internships included"}
            </p>
            {[
              { name: zh ? "Meta，2025 年 6 月以前" : "Meta, before June 2025", k: everBefore, of: total },
              { name: zh ? "Microsoft，2025 年 11 月以前" : "Microsoft, before November 2025", k: msBefore, of: msTotal },
            ].map((r) => (
              <div class="mx-ck-row thin">
                <p class="mx-ck-name">
                  {r.name} <span>{n(r.of)}</span>
                </p>
                <div class="mx-ck-track">
                  <span style={`width: ${(r.k / r.of) * 100}%`} />
                </div>
                <b class="mx-ck-v">{pct(r.k / r.of)}</b>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
          <FigNotes
            slot="notes"
            lang={lang}
            shows={
              zh
                ? [
                    `两种口径下，{{hl|成立时已在 Meta}} 的比例只差 ${number(lang, Math.abs(narrowStayed / narrowTotal - stayed / total) * 100, 1)} 个百分点。Microsoft 在 2025 年 11 月宣布组建超级智能团队；用同一口径，它的 ${n(msTotal)} 人中 ${pct(msBefore / msTotal)} 以前在 Microsoft 工作过，Meta 是 ${pct(everBefore / total)}。`,
                  ]
                : [
                    `Under the two definitions, the share {{hl|at Meta when it formed}} differs by ${number(lang, Math.abs(narrowStayed / narrowTotal - stayed / total) * 100, 1)} points. Microsoft announced its own superintelligence team in November 2025; on the same measure, ${pct(msBefore / msTotal)} of its ${n(msTotal)} had worked at Microsoft before, against ${pct(everBefore / total)} at Meta.`,
                  ]
            }
            method={
              zh
                ? [
                    `以前在 Meta、当时不在的 ${n(hadBeen)} 人中，${n(returned)} 人离开后又回来，${n(interns)} 人只实习过。Microsoft 的 ${n(msTotal)} 人是当前在 Microsoft、标题或职位写有 superintelligence 的档案；抽读时发现其中有招聘人员，而且公司名不包括 LinkedIn、GitHub 等子公司。只写年份的日期按 1 月算，所以只写了 2025 年结束的工作算作在 2025 年 5 月以前结束，可能把人算进离开后又回来的 ${n(returned)} 人。个人档案截至 2026 年 4 月，这对 Microsoft 团队成立以来那几个月的影响比对 Meta 大，所以它的比例可能偏高。`,
                  ]
                : [
                    `Of the ${n(hadBeen)} who had worked at Meta but not then, ${n(returned)} left and came back and ${n(interns)} had only interned. Microsoft's ${n(msTotal)} are profiles with a current Microsoft job whose headline or title says superintelligence; reads found recruiters among them, and the company names leave out subsidiaries such as LinkedIn and GitHub. A date given only as a year reads as January, so an entry that ended in 2025 without a month counts as ending before May 2025, which can move someone into the ${n(returned)} who returned. Profiles stop in April 2026, which hides more of Microsoft's months since its team formed than of Meta's, so its share is likely biased upward.`,
                  ]
            }
          />
        </Figure>

        <Figure
          id="moves"
          level={3}
          number="03"
          lang={lang}
          heading={
